reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|R|,[x]_R,Q:=|R|/R\">\\(|R|,[x]_R,Q:=|R|/R\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 为任意集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:|R|\\to Y\">\\(f:|R|\\to Y\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline f\">\\(\\overline f\\)</span> 是下式定义的关系；只有满足显示的等价条件时才将其作为商集上的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline f:=\\{\\langle[x]_R,f(x)\\rangle:x\\in|R|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline f:=\\{\\langle[x]_R,f(x)\\rangle:x\\in|R|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in|R|\\ (xRy\\Rightarrow f(x)=f(y))\\bigr)\n&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\overline f:Q\\to Y\\\\\n&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists!g\\in Y^Q\\ \\forall x\\in|R|\\ (g([x]_R)=f(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in|R|\\ (xRy\\Rightarrow f(x)=f(y))\\bigr)\n&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\overline f:Q\\to Y\\\\\n&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists!g\\in Y^Q\\ \\forall x\\in|R|\\ (g([x]_R)=f(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PER在其支撑上是等价关系，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x]_R=[y]_R\">\\([x]_R=[y]_R\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xRy\">\\(xRy\\)</span>：一个方向由传递、对称性；另一方向用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xRx\">\\(xRx\\)</span> 得x属于同一类。故同一个类上的函数值唯一正好等于显示的不变条件，覆盖性来自商集的定义。任何候选g必须在每个类上取该值，因此唯一。空支撑时，商集及关系都为空，空函数仍满足全部等价。此结果严格支持既有类型系统把商集上的成员关系函数拉回支撑的做法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T)$，$|R|,[x]_R,Q:=|R|/R$ 取 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]；$Y$ 为任意集合，$f:|R|\\to Y$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"|R|,[x]_R,Q:=|R|/R","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:|R|\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline f","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline f:=\\{\\langle[x]_R,f(x)\\rangle:x\\in|R|\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in|R|\\ (xRy\\Rightarrow f(x)=f(y))\\bigr)\n&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\overline f:Q\\to Y\\\\\n&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists!g\\in Y^Q\\ \\forall x\\in|R|\\ (g([x]_R)=f(x)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[x]_R=[y]_R","display":false},{"tex":"xRy","display":false},{"tex":"xRx","display":false}],"bytes":1854,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-430","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-per-family-descent|thm-per-family-descent — 类上不变函数与商集函数的对应]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-462","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-per-family-descent]]"},{"id":"9e7370aef3007b80","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：由 [[72-thm-per-family-descent]]，原有的aEb蕴涵L(a)=L(b)精确保证商图单值，并给唯一的商集函数。空类型相等关系时，支撑、商集及纤维函数都为空，仍符合构造。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-per-family-descent|thm-per-family-descent — 类上不变函数与商集函数的对应]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-520","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-per-family-descent]]"}],"outgoing":["855f0d0656844c14"]}